<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/sha_spell_fire_felfirenova.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sha of Anger</span></h3>Sha of Anger is notable in that it drops 496-iLvl Tier 14 legs and gloves, as well as various 483-iLvl Malevolent Gladiator's pieces. This is a great way to get a head start on your tier set if you get lucky. <br/>
<br/>The first time you kill the Sha of Anger, it will also drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89317/claw-of-anger">
<img alt="Claw of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_shaclaw.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw of Anger</span></a>. This can be turned in for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90907/boots-of-unbreakable-umbrage">
<img alt="Boots of Unbreakable Umbrage" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_mail_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of Unbreakable Umbrage</span></a>, a decent early pair of boots.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Reputation Items for Elemental Shamans</span></h2>Reputation gear can be very strong, and in Phase 3 you will mostly be looking to level up your standing with the new <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1435/shado-pan-assault">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shado-Pan Assault</span></a> faction, which has most of the useful high item level gear for sale. You can gain reputation with them by doing the <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6622/throne-of-thunder">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Throne of Thunder</span></a> raid, although we will not be using any of the listed gear in this guide since it is for <b>pre-raid items only</b>.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="shado-pan-assault">
